# What: Line-ending rules for git.
# How: Shell scripts and git hooks are always checked out with LF, even by Git for Windows (which defaults to CRLF).
# Objective: setup.sh, the session-start sync and the git hooks run in Git Bash on Windows ("pipefail\r: invalid option" otherwise).
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
club-agent/githooks/* text eol=lf
.husky/* text eol=lf
